<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>Upcoming Events, Tours and Gigs</h1>
            <p>Lorem ipsum, dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dignissimos consectetur rem cupiditate quae totam voluptatem odit eaque eveniet ex vitae odio consequatur, obcaecati eos sit, asperiores ducimus alias. Sint, eveniet!</p>
            <p>Check out our <a href="./past-events/">past events</a> to see how prolific we are!</p>
          </div>
          <div class="img-container">
            <img src="/assets/img/content/turku--resized.jpg" alt="">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper--narrow">
        <ul class="event-list">
          <li class="event">
            <span class="event__detail event__detail--large"><a href="">Battle Beast</a></span>
            <span class="event__detail event__detail--medium">Featuring Agalloch, Mare Cognitum, Finnr's Cane</span>
            <span class="event__detail event__detail--small">December 15, 2023 - Ikaalinen spa, Ikaalinen</span>
            <hr>
          </li>
          <li class="event">
            <span class="event__detail event__detail--large"><a href="">Battle Beast</a></span>
            <span class="event__detail event__detail--small">December 16, 2023 - Aulanko, Hämeenlinna</span>
            <hr>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
